<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<main id="main">
  <%- include('../partials/page-hero', { heading: 'About CoreByte Solutions', lead: 'A software development company in Ludhiana, Punjab, building practical technology for businesses across India and beyond.' }) %>

  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container about">
      <div class="about__story prose" data-reveal>
        <h2 class="section-title section-title--sm">The core of the business, in bytes</h2>
        <p>The name says what we do. Every business has a core: the handful of processes that decide whether the day goes well. Our job is to turn that core into software — the bytes that record, calculate, print, validate and report so people don’t have to do it by hand.</p>
        <p>We work across custom desktop and web applications, AI integration and business automation. We have particular depth in logistics and customs-related operations: CFS management, gate and container handling, weighbridge systems, transport and bilty software, and tools built around applicable ICEGATE/SCMTR technical specifications.</p>
        <p>We also look after the infrastructure that keeps software running — domains, hosting and business email — so clients have one accountable team from the first conversation to long-term support.</p>
        <h2 class="section-title section-title--sm">What’s next</h2>
        <p>CoreByte Solutions is preparing to offer Customs House Agent (CHA) services and to expand into selected import/export activities. Details will be announced soon. <a class="text-link" href="/trade">Read about our plans</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="about__facts" data-reveal style="--d:1" aria-label="Company facts">
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Company</dt><dd><%= site.name %></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd><%= site.location.city %>, <%= site.location.region %>, <%= site.location.country %></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Serving</dt><dd>Businesses across India and beyond</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Focus</dt><dd>Custom software, web, AI, CFS &amp; ICEGATE/SCMTR solutions, automation, hosting</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Website</dt><dd><a href="<%= site.url %>"><%= site.domain %></a></dd></div>
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--deep" aria-labelledby="why-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <h2 id="why-title" class="section-title">How we work</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="why" role="list">
        <% content.why.forEach((w, i) => { %>
          <li class="why__item" data-reveal style="--d:<%= i %>">
            <span class="why__icon"><%- icon(w.icon) %></span>
            <h3><%= w.title %></h3>
            <p><%= w.text %></p>
          </li>
        <% }) %>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="process-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <h2 id="process-title" class="section-title">From first conversation to support</h2>
      </div>
      <%- include('../partials/process', { steps: content.process }) %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('../partials/cta') %>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
